rrival live side by side in a Madrid that’s hotter and more chaotic than ever. In this context, detectives Velarde and Alfaro must find what seems to be a serial killer. Their against-the-clock hunt will make them realise something they’d never imagined: neither of them are so very different from the killer."},{"language":"es-ES","title":"Que Dios nos perdone","overview":"Madrid, verano de 2011. Crisis económica, Movimiento 15-M y millón y medio de peregrinos que esperan la llegada del Papa conviven en un Madrid más caluroso, violento y caótico que nunca. En este contexto, los inspectores de policía Alfaro y Velarde deben encontrar al que parece ser un asesino en serie cuanto antes y sin hacer ruido. Esta caza contrarreloj les hará darse cuenta de algo que nunca habían pensado: ninguno de los dos es tan diferente del asesino."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2lWavdmzThykDGctr16Qlvy4Fgd.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/92oqNzaQrXbqc7ewO2BPfnLBVvi.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":394684,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2lWavdmzThykDGctr16Qlvy4Fgd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2lWavdmzThykDGctr16Qlvy4Fgd.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2lWavdmzThykDGctr16Qlvy4Fgd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2lWavdmzThykDGctr16Qlvy4Fgd.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3AT6xdDToEDtLpstmim0Ks1mhYf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3AT6xdDToEDtLpstmim0Ks1mhYf.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oVcFSWmRvubWWw8p5FEg7WXJlYR.